//
// Pure-Python ABI/layout checks for the packed GEMM spatial fanout
// helpers (build_packed_gemm.packed_gemm_elf_name, packed_host_sizes,
// and run_tiled_mc._pack_gemm_spatial_inputs).
//
// No NPU dispatch — these guard the dispatcher-side layout decisions so
// any regression surfaces before an actual on-device test would even
// build an ELF. Fast (sub-second).
//
// REQUIRES: peano, torch
//
// RUN: python3 %S/conv/test_packed_gemm_unit.py
